  "id": "wason-selection-task",
  "term": "Wason selection task",
  "definition": "The Wason selection task is a logical reasoning task used to study how people evaluate conditional statements such as “if p, then q.” In this paradigm, people solve inference problems so researchers can examine factors that influence reasoning performance, including emotion and problem content.",
